{
  "name": "GuWorld",
  "description": "A text-based RPG web game inspired by Reverend Insanity (Cổ Chân Nhân), combining macro resource management, survival, deck-building, and turn-based combat where all abilities come from equipped Gu insects rather than innate character talent. The stack pairs a Go (Gin) backend for concurrent game logic and combat with a Next.js (React) frontend using Tailwind CSS and Zustand, backed by PostgreSQL and Redis.",
